    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "'law enforcement authority' means: (a) any public authority competent for ..."

-- src:117 | (b) any other body or entity entrusted by Member State law to exercise public authority and public powers for the purposes of the prevention, investigation, detection or prosecution of criminal offences or the execution of criminal penalties, including the safeguarding against and the prevention of threats to public security;
