§ `Article 3(49) to (52): serious incident and the borrowed data terms`

-- src:121 | (49) ‘serious incident’ means an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system that directly or indirectly leads to any of the following:
-- src:122 | (a) the death of a person, or serious harm to a person’s health;
-- src:123 | (b) a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure;
-- src:124 | (c) the infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights;
-- src:125 | (d) serious harm to property or the environment;
@ref Art 3(49) (src:121-125)
-- The four limbs are alternatives ("any of the following"); the incident or malfunctioning must lead to at least one,
-- directly or indirectly.
GIVEN `the event is an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it directly or indirectly leads to the death of a person, or serious harm to a person's health` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it directly or indirectly leads to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it directly or indirectly leads to the infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it directly or indirectly leads to serious harm to property or the environment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 3(49) the event is a serious incident` MEANS
        `the event is an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system`
    AND (   `it directly or indirectly leads to the death of a person, or serious harm to a person's health`
         OR `it directly or indirectly leads to a serious and irreversible disruption of the management or operation of critical infrastructure`
         OR `it directly or indirectly leads to the infringement of obligations under Union law intended to protect fundamental rights`
         OR `it directly or indirectly leads to serious harm to property or the environment`)
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "'serious incident' means an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system that directly or indirectly leads to any of the following"

-- src:126 | (50) ‘personal data’ means personal data as defined in Article 4, point (1), of Regulation (EU) 2016/679;
@ref Art 3(50) (src:126)
GIVEN `the data is personal data as defined in Article 4, point (1), of Regulation (EU) 2016/679` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 3(50) the data is personal data` MEANS
